gFV(){return"Flutter developer with over 3 years of hands-on experience building cross-platform iOS and Android apps, from university projects and internships to a Junior Flutter Developer role at Ball Squad. I write Dart code organised in layers in the spirit of Clean Architecture, manage state with BLoC/Cubit and rely on dependency injection (get_it) and code generation (build_runner)."},
gFW(){return"I work daily with AI agents, mainly Claude and Claude Code, to speed up implementation, refactoring, writing tests and code review, while keeping responsibility for code quality. I hold an MSc in Computer Science and I want to grow on international client projects, learning from experienced tech leads and sharing knowledge with the team."},
